            <ArticleTitle>Immediate angioplasty results of total coronary artery occlusion in Thai population.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>698-702</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Attempted angioplasty of totally occluded vessels may be done. However, a lower success rate is expected compared to those with subtotal occlusion. The complication rate is comparable to that of partial occlusion in experienced hands.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
